Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}-=THE LAST FANTASY=-  荣誉出品  本字幕仅供学习交流 严禁用于商业途径{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}-=TLF字幕组=-  翻译：白浅  校对：拉拉叫我爆爆{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}灰姑娘的故事：曾经的歌{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}淡定点，因为姐要全力出击了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[SINGING] Hold on `cause I`m letting go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我会俘获你的心，就像牛仔套住斗牛{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m gonna lasso your heart like a rodeo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.38,0:00:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我只会给你一些爱，除非你想要更多{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m gonna give you some Till you want some more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}因为我看到了一扇敞开的门{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}`Cause all I see is an open door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我看到它在指引我，它所有的能量{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}And I see where it`s leading me All of this energy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.10,0:00:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}都被压抑了太久，它很强大，很强大{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Been bottled up way too long It`s powerful, powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你懂我的意思吧，我已经整装待发{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}You see what I`m getting at I`m ready for all of that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}说我不是明星，是你没眼光{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}If I`m not a star, you`re blind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我手戴漂亮戒指，我头发闪闪发亮{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`ve got rings on my fingers And glitter in my hair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我手拿单程票，刚刚抵达此处{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`ve got a one-way ticket And I just got here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我要跑遍这座城市，跑遍这座城市{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m gonna run this town Run this town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我要跑遍这座城市，跑遍这座城市{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m gonna run this town Run this town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.33,0:01:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我脚踩细高跟鞋，我踹开一扇扇心门{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`ve got high heel stilettos And I`m kicking in doors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.13,0:01:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我这么闪亮亮，可不是要讨好你{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}And kissing your ass Ain`t what my lipstick`s for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我要跑遍这座城市，跑遍这座城市{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m gonna run this town Run this town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我要跑遍这座城市，跑遍这座城市{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m gonna run this town Run this town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}早饭呢? 我要吃鸡蛋饼和意大利面!{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Where`s breakfast? I want waffles, spaghetti!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}意大利面和鸡蛋饼!噢!噢!{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Spaghetti waffles! Whoo. Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}维克特，维克特,在房间里乖乖等着{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Victor. Victor. PIease wait in the house, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[VICTOR GROANS]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.11,0:01:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我都闹饥荒了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}My body is entering hunger shock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.11,0:01:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[THUD]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}噢，糟了，猫在书房里便便了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Oh, bad news. The cat pooped in the den.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.20,0:01:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}更糟的是，我用你的毛毯擦便便了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Worse news, I used your blanket to clean it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.66,0:01:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 我们又没养猫  - 我可没骗你噢{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-We don`t have a cat. -No kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[DOOR SLAMS AND VICTOR LAUGHS]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[DOOR CREAKS]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}噢，我…对不起，我以为你还在睡{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Oh. I-- Sorry. I didn`t think you`d be awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.41,0:02:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}您和盖伊·摩根…{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}You have an appointment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}…有个约会，您应该不想迟到吧{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}...with Guy Morgan, I didn`t think you`d wanna be Iate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}噢，你想的真周全，宝贝{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Oh, Iook at you thinking. Cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}但画肖像画的时间还是有的{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}But I always have time for my portrait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}画师，画得再像点{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Look alive. Paint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我有点头晕{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m feeling spiritually blocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}备好热水，我要洗芝麻浴{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Draw me a sesame seed bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}芝麻浴!快去准备{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Bath. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}现在，把老娘我画得再漂亮点，再瘦点{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Now, make momma Iook more beautiful and thinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[WATER RUNNING]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}放水声音小点{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}And make that water more quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.27,0:02:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 贝芙，你起床了没?  - 当然{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Bev, you awake? -Of course I`m awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}要是等你来才起，我早就迟到了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}If I waited for you, I`d never be on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}幸亏你从没等过我{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Lucky you never wait for me then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.21,0:03:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}维克特，不要{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}KATIE: Victor, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}额，您不用杯子盛着喝吗?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Uh, don`t you want a glass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}恩，泥土味，有点鱼腥味，  还有点可爱的沙子味{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Hmm. Earthy. A tad fishy. Lovely gravel finish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你又让维克特在果汁机里放虫子了?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Did you Iet Victor put worms in the blender again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}是的，我是说…不是我让他放的{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Yes. I mean, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我是说，是他自己放的{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I mean, it just happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}想害死我，门都没有{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}You know nothing can kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.99,0:03:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}绝对不可能{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}踩油门，凯蒂，这个约会我可不能迟到{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}GAIL: Step on it, Katie. I cannot be Iate for this meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}必要的话，就从这些人身上开过去{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Just run them over if you have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:03:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[STUDENTS SCREAMING]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[CELL PHONE RINGS AND GAIL SIGHS]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你好，不，学生们不需要什么图书馆{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Hello? No, the kids don`t need a Iibrary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我是校长，我说了算，我要改建办公室{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I am the dean, and the dean gets what she wants, and I wanna remodel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.09,0:04:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你太无聊了，我说的是实话，  我们没什么可谈的了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}You`re just boring. I`m being honest. I don`t know what else to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.72,0:04:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}而且要在我和盖伊·摩根会面之前搞定{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}GAIL: And I wanted my office done for my meeting with Guy Morgan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}…他是音乐界泰斗，可你把我的话当耳边风{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}...the music mogul, but no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}还把舞会的主题定为宝莱坞?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}And using Bollywood as a theme for the dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}一点美国味都没有，我才不管是不是我说的{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}That`s totally un-American. I don`t care if it was my idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你好啊{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}GUY: Hello. GAIL: Oh. Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.77,0:04:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我是凡·莱文斯威校长，您是--{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m Dean Van Ravensway, and you must be--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 盖伊·摩根  - 没错，盖伊·摩根先生，见到你很高兴{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Guy Morgan. -Ah, yes. Guy Morgan, a pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}您看起来就是见多识广的人{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}You Iook Iike a man who knows things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.57,0:04:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}哈哈，也许我知道的太多了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Aha, even some things I shouldn`t know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 我是鲁克  - 很好{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-And I`m Luke. GAIL: Great.{\r}
