Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.35,0:04:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 现在，来说说我儿子吧  - 好啊{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Now, Iet`s talk about my son. -Of course.{\r}
