Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}威尔斯利学院有个很棒的商务课程，  我们就是冲着这个来的{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Wellesley has a great business program. That`s why we`re here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}音乐界只有两种人：艺术家和生意人{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}There are two types of people in the music biz: artists and businessmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 鲁克是当生意人的料  - 当然{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Luke is a businessman. -Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}凯蒂!过来，精神点，给你点事儿做{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Katie, get in here. Look alive. Make yourself useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}鲁克需要熟悉下校园的环境{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Luke is gonna need a tour of the campus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}给贝芙发条短信，让她陪鲁克逛逛{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}So text Bev and ask her to escort Mr. Morgan around campus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}鲁克，要是你有令尊一半的制作人潜质…{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Now, Luke, if you are half as talented a producer as your father--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}现在下结论还早，他还差得远{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}The verdict`s still out. He hasn`t earned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}听过我在音乐界的奋斗史吗?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Heard the story of how I started in the music business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 听过，爸爸，每个人都听过  - 那每个人都该知道故事的发展了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Yes, everybody`s heard it, Dad. -Then everybody should know how it goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}那时我还在为滚石乐队工作…{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}There I was, working for The Rolling Stones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- …当时米克他…  - 爸{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-...when Mick himself-- -Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}好，不说了，重点是我儿子还不成器{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Fine. As I said, the verdict is still out on my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.87,0:06:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}他才只出了一张专辑，叫果味危机乐队?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}He just produced an album with the Fruity Dangers?{\r}
