Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}谢谢你，难得能遇到听过他们专辑的人{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Thank you. Rare I meet anyone who`s heard their album.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你说笑吧?那支乐队红极一时的{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}What, are you kidding? They`re a cult phenomenon.{\r}
