Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我想要鲁克学会如何发掘有商业价值的新星{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}GUY: What I need is for Luke to Iearn to spot a commercially viable star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}形象不要太差，明白吗?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Image drives the bottom Iine, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我明白，要是贾斯汀·比伯又丑又矮，  能有比伯热潮嘛?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I feel you. Would we have Bieber Fever if he were an ugly troll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}说实话，他是有点矮，对吧?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Actually, he is a tad hobbit-Iike, isn`t he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我希望能由鲁克监制贵校的学期汇演…{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`d Iike Luke to produce your Semester Showcase...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- …看看他能不能发掘出受欢迎的新人  - 学期汇演一向是我来筹办的{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-...to see if he can identify sellable talent. -I produce the Semester Showcase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我会出双倍的汇演预算经费{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I will double your Showcase budget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}也会邀请所有我认识的星探{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I will invite every talent scout I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}这将是我们相互合作的开始…{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}This could be the beginning of a relationship...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}…韦尔斯利学院和肯星顿唱片公司合作{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}...between Wellesley and Kensington Records.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我们学校似乎要迎来一位新的制作人了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Looks Iike we have a new producer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}对了，这是我的女儿，贝芙{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Oh, and this is my daughter, Bev.{\r}
