Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你能带他的儿子鲁克观赏下校园吗?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Could you give his son, Luke, a tour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}当然,你想参观威尔斯利学院吗?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Sure. Would you Iike to see the Wellesley perks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}额，好啊，很期待，我很乐意{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Um, yes, brilliant. Sure.{\r}
