Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你还傻愣在这儿干嘛?出去{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}What are you still doing here? Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我和盖伊有要事商谈，你出去，马上!{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Guy and I have things we need to discuss. Out. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}盖伊，能不能讲讲，  您那时在米克手下工作的感觉呢?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}So, Guy, you`ve gotta tell me, what was that Iike working under Mick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}小心!{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Watch out.{\r}
