Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 你有鼓起勇气把唱片交给他吗?  - 喂!{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-So you womanned up and did it? BOY 1 : Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.89,0:07:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 算给了  - 喂!{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Oh, I did it. BOY 1 : Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.89,0:07:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 究竟怎样?  - 能把球还给我们吗?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-What happened? BOY 2: Can we have our ball?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}可我没能把我的的CD给鲁克{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I didn`t give my CD to Luke.{\r}
