Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.11,0:07:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}但至少盖伊·摩根有你的录音带了呀，  很了不起了，你只要得到赏识{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}But Guy Morgan has your demo. That`s huge. What you need is a champion.{\r}
