Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.72,0:33:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}但是从来没上过镜{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}But I never got my shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.43,0:34:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我本来在肯德基工作，一天，格尔夫人来了…{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m working at KFC, and one day, Gail comes in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.80,0:34:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}…她说，"你是印度人吗?" 我说，"什么?"{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}...she`s Iike, ``Are you Indian?`` I`m Iike, ``What?``{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.39,0:34:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}她说，"你是古鲁（印度教精神导师）吗?"  我说：{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}She`s Iike, ``Are you a guru?`` I`m Iike:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.77,0:34:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}"这就要看谁问了?"{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[IN INDIAN ACCENT] ``Who is asking?``{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.52,0:34:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}她说："我要付钱做个精神指引"{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[IN NORMAL VOICE] She says, ``Someone who`s paying for some spiritual guidance.``{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.06,0:34:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我当时想："这真是奇迹!"{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}And I`m Iike, ``Whaa! It`s a miracle!``{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.82,0:34:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我终于有机会全身心投入去演戏了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I finally get a chance to do a total immersion into a character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.49,0:34:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}锻炼演技，还有钱拿，天助我也啊{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Real training and I get paid. Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.95,0:34:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}拉维就是我要演的角色{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Ravi is my King Lear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.66,0:34:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你想听《窈窕淑女》里的经典独白吗?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[IN ENGLISH ACCENT] You wanna hear the monologue from My Fair Lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.50,0:34:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 噢，老兄  - 不用，谢了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Oy, mate. -No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.87,0:34:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}对不起，我没打招呼就闯进来了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`m sorry I barged in. Whoops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.75,0:34:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[KATIE CHUCKLES]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.38,0:34:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我会替你保密的，但我也需要你帮忙{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Your secret`s safe with me, okay? But I need to ask you a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.72,0:34:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 肉球  - 哈，肉球{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Meatball. -Ha, Meatball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.97,0:34:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}今晚请帮我看好维克特，这样我就能去参加舞会了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}PIease watch Victor tonight so I can go to the dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.60,0:34:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}这么点小事?没问题{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Are you kidding me? Done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.83,0:34:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[SIGHS]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.22,0:34:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}一言为定{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}BIow it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.73,0:34:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[MIMICS EXPLOSION]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.52,0:34:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}谢谢你{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[CHUCKLES]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.94,0:35:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[INDIAN DANCE MUSIC PLAYING ON SPEAKERS]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.86,0:35:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}哇噢{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}ANGELA: Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.45,0:35:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}每个人都戴着面具，我怎么找鲁克啊?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}KATIE: How am I supposed to find Luke if everybody`s got a mask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.24,0:35:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我没说过这会很简单，我们先找找看{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}ANGELA: I never said this was gonna be easy. Let`s do some recon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.48,0:35:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[CLEARS THROAT]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.71,0:35:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我是首席助理桃乐西·皮伯格{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I am Assistant Principal Dorothy PIumberg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.21,0:35:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}不能喝酒，不能发短信，不能接吻{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}No drinking. No texting. No kissing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.13,0:35:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}鲁克?不是，鲁克·摩根?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Luke? No. Luke Morgan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.26,0:35:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}不能离开屋子，不能找乐子{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}No Ieaving the premises and no experiencing joy of any kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.60,0:35:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}鲁克?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Luke? Ugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.11,0:35:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[KATIE SIGHS]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.31,0:35:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}他在哪儿呢?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.56,0:35:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我想起来了，要你看场新表演{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}That reminds me. I got a new act for you to Iisten to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.57,0:35:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 现在?  - 择日不如撞日{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Now? -No time Iike it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.40,0:35:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 大哥，别这样  - 我们是大痛票乐队{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-Dude, not again-- -We`re called Big Pain Ticket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.82,0:35:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}[CHAIN SAW REVVING]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.33,0:35:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}天崩地裂也要吻你{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I wanna kiss your apocalypse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.08,0:35:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}海枯石烂也要拥抱你{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Wrap you in my Armageddon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.58,0:35:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}为你唱首拧巴的小夜曲{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Sing you a twisted serenade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.96,0:35:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}他们唱得不错，可是我担心那电锯不安全{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}They`re good, but I`m worried that chain saw`s unsafe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.88,0:36:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}大哥，我觉得那电锯才是亮点{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Dude, the chain saw`s, Iike, the best part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.10,0:36:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我想我找到他了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I think I found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.35,0:36:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}金发男啊{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}ANGELA: Well, he is blond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.73,0:36:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}噢，老天，她来这干嘛?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Oh, my God, what is she doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.94,0:36:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我讨厌这些年轻人疯来疯去的{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I hate teenage desperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.40,0:36:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你来这干嘛?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.95,0:36:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}亲爱的，赛猪想要赢得比赛…{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Oh, honey, the prize pig doesn`t win the blue ribbon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.95,0:36:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}…可不能盖住它的第三大宝贵资产噢{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}...by covering up its third best asset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.16,0:36:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}这话什么意思，还有，你刚才把我比成猪了?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}A, what does that even mean and, B, did you just call me a pig?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.29,0:36:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}亲爱的，我看到你在…{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Honey, I saw you making sweet Iove...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.29,0:36:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}…餐桌上狂吃那盘瑞典肉丸{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}...to a plate of Swedish meatballs at the snack table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.17,0:36:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}机不可失，失不再来哦，亲{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}It`s now or never, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.84,0:36:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 万一她发现我了怎么办?  - 我去分散她的注意力，快走{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-What if she recognizes me? -I`II distract her. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.47,0:36:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 是我对了还是是我对了?  - 你是对的{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-So was I right or was I right? -You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.80,0:36:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你品位不错，但要是敢再在男厕开试唱会…{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}You have very cool taste. Any more auditions in the men`s...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.85,0:36:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}…你就被开除了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}...and you`re fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.81,0:37:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 我知道你的秘密  - 什么秘密?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-I know your secret. -Which secret is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.98,0:37:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我听到你在学校唱的歌了{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I heard you sing at school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.69,0:37:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}你唱得很棒{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}You were amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.99,0:37:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我认识你吗?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Do I know you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.41,0:37:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}- 我想让你看点东西  - 你叫什么名字?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}-I wanna show you something. -What`s your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.33,0:37:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}安吉拉，你在干嘛?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Angela, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.04,0:37:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}我有个请求{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I`d Iike to make a request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.05,0:37:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}今晚不会让你失望的，我保证{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}I will make your night. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.05,0:37:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}凡·莱文斯威夫人{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}ANGELA: Miss Van R.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.05,0:37:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}听说您年轻的时候想当一名舞者，是真的吗?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}Is it true you wanted to be a dancer when you were younger...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.64,0:37:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs25\bord0}但是听说您的舞跳得不怎么样?{\r}\N{\fn@Arial Unicode MS\fs25\bord0\fscx65\fscy60\1c&H55B9F4&}...but were never good enough?{\r}
